---
description: AzexAI Systems public website conventions
globs: src/**/*.{ts,tsx}, messages/*.json
alwaysApply: false
---

This repo is the AzexAI Systems corporate site, not the VSM platform.

- Keep copy in `messages/az.json`, `ru.json`, `en.json` — no hardcoded UI strings
- Do not invent leadership bios, customer logos, scores, Plus names, or methodology internals
- Contact must not claim success unless email actually sent
- Preserve ink / bronze / signal brand; no shadcn/SaaS restyle
- Server Components by default; `"use client"` only for interactive islands
